      "caption": {
       "has_translation": null,
       "created_at": 1682671824,
       "pk": "18040767232415812",
       "text": "‘Ceremony’ - she’s here!\nIt’s hard to think of the words to say… I will try to write more about it over the next few days. \nHuge love & gratitude to my bandmates Cass, Alex & Tom for the work that has gone into this. Thank you listeners, for your patience and support of our music. It’s available to listen to / buy now in all the usual places. \n\ncredits -\nall songs written by hollie fullbrook\nall songs performed by hollie fullbrook, cass basil, alex freer & tom healy \n\nvocals, acoustic & electric guitars, cello - hollie\nbass guitars, upright bass, backing vocals, fife - cass\ndrums & percussion - alex\nelectric guitars, 12 string guitar, mellotron, hammond b3 organ, piano, oberheim xpander, minimoog, fender rhodes, backing vocals - tom\n\nall songs recorded at paquin studios, auckland & engineered by tom healy, except for -\ntracks 8 & 10 recorded at roundhead studios & paquin studios, auckland - engineered by emily wheatcroft-snape, alex corbett & tom healy\ntrack 9 recorded at paquin studios & alex freer studios - engineered by tom healy & alex freer\n\nmixed by tom healy at paquin studios\nproduced by tom healy at paquin studios\nmastered by christian wright at abbey road\ncover art painting by christiane shortal / @icyforksart \nphoto of painting by @mac_snapper \nart direction by hollie fullbrook\nart layout by angus mcbryde\nmade with the support of @nzonairmusic\n\nThank you to everyone who helped us along the way🌹 & special thanks to the labels who have done so much work to get this to your ears - @milkrecords, @marathonartists & @badabingrecords ❤️ \n\n📷 by @francescarter"
      },
